Subject: [PATCH] Sync running tip: auto-heal Anthropic + launch profile dirs

Bring the patchset current with the live Simulachrome tip used in development.
Prefer overlays/3155/ full-file copy (see APPLY.txt).

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
---
diff --git a/chrome/test/data/webui/glic/test_client/TIP_SYNC_3155.md b/chrome/test/data/webui/glic/test_client/TIP_SYNC_3155.md
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/chrome/test/data/webui/glic/test_client/TIP_SYNC_3155.md
@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+# 3155 — Sync running tip (auto-heal Anthropic + launch dirs)
+
+## Summary
+- Auto-heal uses Settings provider/model (`__DASH_PROVIDER` / `__DASH_MODEL`)
+- Removes non-working pinned `claude-haiku-4-5-20251001` from dropdowns; aliases remap
+- C++ Anthropic chat remaps retired model ids
+- `start_glic_dev.sh` creates DevProfile / Scripts / Headless / SimulachromeData roots
+
+## Apply
+Use full-file overlay (preferred):
+
+```
+rsync -a overlays/3155/chrome/ "$CHROMIUM_SRC/chrome/"
+```
+
+See overlays/3155/APPLY.txt.
